#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""[rollplay] THE ROLL TAG + the Script popup Roll tab (script-page.js)

PineRollTag.mount(container, line, opts): the Message view bubble replayed
off the air for any line, with the rolls / databases / lists under it; the
Script popup gets a first tab, Roll, the default when the popup opens.
Targets: desktop/renderer/script-page.js and app/src/main/assets/pine-views/script-page.js

  python edit_rollplay_script_page.py --check <file> [<file> ...]   exit 0 ready / 2 applied / 1 anchor missing
  python edit_rollplay_script_page.py --apply <file> [<file> ...]   idempotent; resumes a half-applied file

Marker-idempotent: an edit counts as APPLIED when its whole replacement is in
the file, READY when its anchor occurs exactly once. Line endings are kept
(a CRLF file stays CRLF, an LF file LF). The write is atomic, and a .js file
must pass `node --check` (when node is on PATH) before it replaces the old
one; a .json file must parse.
"""
